<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <nav>
      <p>Menu 1</p>
      <p>Menu 2</p>
      <p>Menu 3</p>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h2 id="titulo">Aula 3 - Javascript DOM</h2>
    <p class="comandos">getElementById</p>
    <p class="comandos">getElementsByTagName</p>
    <p class="comandos">getElementsByClassName</p>
    <p>Comandos para pegar os elementos.</p>
    <p id="ex4">4 - Alterar a cor do id "ex1", do segundo item da classe comandos para a cor verde </p>
  </main>
  <div>

  </div>
  <script>
    //1
    document.getElementsByTagName("p")
    [0].innerHTML = "Item 1";
    //2
    document.getElementsByName("p")
    [1].innerHTML = "Item 2";
    //3
    document.getElementsByClassName("comandos")[0].
      innerHTML = document.getElementsByClassName
        ("comandos")[1].innerHTML + "()";
    document.getElementsByClassName("comandos")[1].
      innerHTML = document.getElementsByClassName
        ("comandos")[2].innerHTML + "()";
    document.getElementsByClassName("comandos")[2].
      innerHTML = document.getElementsByClassName
        ("comandos")[3].innerHTML + "()";
    //4
    document.getElementById("ex1").style.color = "green";
    document.getElementsByClassName("comandos")[1].
      style.color = "green"
  </script>
</body>

</html>